{"title":"Mock AIME 5 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/2/9e2722d7c4bd448964c25c6e26465b1c0434597c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 101^4 + 256$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"16\" />. Find the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Binomial_theorem\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Binomial theorem\">binomial theorem</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/9/1298488e62ea87ea09c4785246bb45e193fcfdf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{aligned} 101^4 + 256 &amp;= (100 + 1)^4 + 256 \\\\ &amp;= (100^4 + 4\\cdot 100^3 + 6 \\cdot 100^2 + 4 \\cdot 100 + 1) + 256 \\\\  &amp;= 104060401 + 256 = 104060657, \\end{aligned}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -29px\" width=\"470\" height=\"71\" /> and so the sum of the digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/a/f5af788ccc53266336b210ca23e1b8a463d20649.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+4+6+6+5+7 = \\boxed{29}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"223\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_Pre_2005\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 Pre 2005\">Mock AIME 5 Pre 2005</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_Pre_2005_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 Pre 2005 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=28368\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 13 (page does not exist)\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" cl